<item><title>Praia raises annual grants for three music groups to 750,000 escudos</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/praia-raises-annual-grants-for-three-music-groups-to-750-0f8d89/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/praia-raises-annual-grants-for-three-music-groups-to-750-0f8d89/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The municipality raised Ferro Gaita&apos;s grant from 500,000 escudos and extended the same annual support to Bulimundo and Os Tubarões.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:02:14 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
